 "text": {
  "fr": {
   "name": "Mega Man X2",
   "genre": "Plateforme / Shooter Scrolling",
   "synopsis": "X est de retour...\r\nMais cette fois il est encore plus rapide et plus dangereux. Dr. Light donne à Mega Man des capacités nouvelles incroyables qui sont cachées dans des capsules enterrées profondément sous la surface de la terre. C'est avec elles qu'il faut vaincre 21 X-hunter pour rendre la paix à la Terre.",
   "synopsis_lang": "fr"
  },
  "en": {
   "name": "Mega Man X2",
   "genre": "Platform / Shooter Scrolling",
   "synopsis": "Sigma, the leader of the Maverick army, was destroyed when he underestimated his opponent: a lone warrior, awakened into a time he never knew...X.\n\n6 months had passed, and X rose to the rank of leader of the Maverick Hunters. His first task was to eliminate the last of the Mavericks. But as he began his assignment, a mysterious group of Reploids calling themselves the X-Hunters appeared with a message to X: the remains of his fallen comrade, Zero, were in the hands of the X-Hunters, and they planned on resurrecting Zero to fight alongside them and for their fallen leader, Sigma.\n\nX must now stop the X-Hunters and rescue Zero, and once again prevent Sigma from rising back into ultimate power.",
   "synopsis_lang": "en"
  }
 },
